hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"990","(96) Miras me warid hone wale ahkam ka bab: Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usamah ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Idris al-Awdi se, Talhah ibn Musarrif se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, {wa likullin ja'alna mawali} ke bare me, unhon ne kaha: Waris, aur Us ke qaul {wallazina aqadat aimanukum fa'atuhum nasibahum} ke bare me, unhon ne kaha: Muhajir jab Madinah aye to Muhajir Ansari ka waris banta tha, us ke rishtedaron ko chhor kar, us bhai-chare ke zariye jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un ke darmiyan karaya tha, phir jab yeh ayat nazil hui: {wa likullin ja'alna mawali} to us ne usay mansukh kar diya, phir unhon ne parha: {wallazina aqadat aimanukum fa'atuhum nasibahum}, madad, khair-khwahi, himayat aur wasiyyat me se, aur miras khatm ho gayi."
"991","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Yazid aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, al-Zuhri se, Ali ibn Husayn se, Amr ibn Uthman se, Usamah ibn Zayd Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya - Ibn al-Muqri ne kaha: aur ek martaba unhon ne kaha: isay Nabi tak pahunchate hue - : Musalman kafir ka waris nahin banta aur na kafir Musalman ka waris banta hai, yeh hadees Ibn al-Muqri ki hai."
"992","al-Za'farani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Affan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ne hum se hadees bayan ki. Aur Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Mughirah ibn Salamah ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Tawus ne hum se hadees bayan ki, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Muqarrar hisse un ke haq-daron tak pahunchao, phir jo bache to woh sab se qareebi mard zikar ke liye hai. al-Za'farani ne Ibn Tawus se (yun) kaha: Sab se qareebi zikar ke liye."
"993","Bahr ibn Nasr ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne mujhe khabar di, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne meri iyadat ki, Aap aur Abu Bakr, Banu Salimah me, to mujhe behosh paya, to unhon ne pani mangwaya aur wuzu kiya, phir us me se mujh par chhinta, to main hosh me a gaya, to main ne kaha: Main apne maal me kis tarah karun Ya Rasulullah? To yeh ayat nazil hui: {yusikumullahu fi auladikum liz-zakari mislu hazzil-unsayayn}."
"994","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ibn Raja ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Isra'il ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abu Hasin se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Jo maal chhor jaye to woh us ke asaba ke liye hai, aur jo bojh ya zaya hone wali aulad chhor jaye to woh meri taraf hai, main us ka wali hun."
"995","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn al-Munkadir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Main bimar hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) meri iyadat ke liye tashreef laye, Aap aur Abu Bakr, aur woh dono paidal the, aur mujh par behoshi tari hui thi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne wuzu kiya phir apna wuzu ka pani mujh par dala, to main hosh me a gaya, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main apne maal me kis tarah faisla karun? Main apne maal me kya karun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujhe jawab na diya, yahan tak ke miras ki ayat nazil hui. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Abu al-Zubayr ne kaha: Us ke bare me nazil hui: {yastaftunaka qulillahu yuftikum fil-kalalah}."
"996","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Shihab se, Uthman ibn Ishaq ibn Kharashah se, Qabisah ibn Dhu'ayb se, unhon ne kaha: Ek dadi Abu Bakr ke paas apni miras mangne ayi, to unhon ne kaha: Kitabullah me tumhare liye kuch nahin hai, aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki sunnat me tumhare liye kuch nahin janta, wapas jao yahan tak ke main logon se puchun, to unhon ne logon se pucha, to al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas hazir tha, Aap ne usay chhata hissa diya, to Abu Bakr ne kaha: Kya tumhare sath tumhare ilawa koi aur hai? To Muhammad ibn Maslamah al-Ansari khare hue aur usi tarah kaha jaise al-Mughirah ne kaha tha, to Abu Bakr ne usay us ke liye nafiz kar diya, phir dusri dadi Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu ke paas apni miras mangne ayi, to unhon ne kaha: Kitabullah me tumhare liye kuch nahin hai, aur woh faisla jo hamein pahuncha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne kiya tha woh tumhare ilawa kisi aur ke liye tha, aur main faraiz me kisi cheez ka izafa karne wala nahin, lekin wohi chhata hissa hai, phir agar tum dono us me jama ho jao to woh tum dono ke darmiyan hai, aur tum me se jo akeli ho us ke liye wohi hai."
"997","Hum se Muhammad ibn Ali ibn al-Hasan ibn Shaqiq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne apne walid ko kehte hue suna: humen Abu al-Munib ne khabar di, Abdullah ibn Buraydah se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne dadi ko chhata hissa diya, jab maan na ho."
"998","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Bishr ibn Umar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hammam ne bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se, ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: mera beta faut ho gaya hai to us ki wirasat me se mera kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: tumhare liye chhata hissa hai, phir jab wo peeth pher kar gaya to use bulaya aur farmaya: tumhare liye ek aur chhata hissa hai, phir jab wo peeth pher kar gaya to use bulaya aur farmaya: dusra chhata hissa mazeed atiya hai. Qatadah ne kaha: to dada kam az kam chhata hissa waris hota hai; kyun ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use chhate hisse ka waris banaya, aur hum nahin jante ke aap ne use kis ke sath waris banaya."
"999","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abd al-Razzaq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humen Sufyan ne khabar di, Abu Qays se, al-Huzayl se, Abdullah Raziallahu anhu se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ke bare me faisla farmaya jis ne apni beti aur pote ki beti aur apni behen chhodi, to aap ne us ki beti ke liye aadha muqarrar kiya, aur pote ki beti ke liye chhata hissa, aur jo baqi bache wo behen ke liye hai."
"1000","Hum se Abu Ja'far al-Darimi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se al-Nadr yani Ibn Shumayl ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humen Shu'bah ne khabar di, Sulayman se, Ibrahim se, al-Aswad ne kaha: Mu'adh ibn Jabal ne hamare darmiyan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ahd me ek shakhs ke bare me faisla kiya jis ne apni beti aur apni behen chhodi, unhon ne kaha: unhon ne us ki beti ke liye aadhe ka aur behen ke liye aadhe ka faisla kiya."
"1001","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abu Nu'aym ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Ayyash ibn Abi Rabi'ah se, Hakim ibn Abbad ibn Hunayf se, Abu Umamah ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf se, unhon ne kaha: Umar ibn al-Khattab ne Abu Ubaydah ibn al-Jarrah ko likha: apne ladkon ko tairna sikhao aur apne jangjuon ko teer-andazi sikhao, unhon ne kaha: to wo nishanon par aate jaate the, unhon ne kaha: to ek anjana teer aaya aur ek ladke ko qatl kar diya jo us ke ek khal ki god me tha jis ki asal maloom na thi, unhon ne kaha: to Abu Ubaydah ne Umar ko likha: main us ki diyyat kisko dun? To Umar Raziallahu anhu ne likha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) farmaya karte the: Allah aur Us ke Rasul us ke wali hain jis ka koi mawla na ho, aur khal us ka waris hai jis ka koi waris na ho."
"1002","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se al-Haytham ibn Jamil aur Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd se, Budayl ibn Maysarah se, Ali ibn Abi Talhah se, Rashid ibn Sa'd se, Abu Amir al-Hawzani se, al-Miqdam al-Kindi se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: main har momin ki jaan se us se zyada haqdar hun, jo qarz ya zaya hone wali aulad chhod jaye — aur al-Haytham ne kaha: ya kalla — to wo meri taraf hai, aur jo maal chhod jaye to wo us ke warison ke liye hai, aur main us ka mawla hun jis ka koi mawla na ho, main us ke maal ka waris hun aur us ke qaidi ko chhudata hun, aur khal us ka mawla hai jis ka koi mawla na ho, wo us ke maal ka waris hai aur us ke qaidi ko chhudata hai."
"1003","Hum se Ibn al-Muqri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: diyyat aqilah ke liye hai, aur aurat apne shohar ki diyyat me se waris nahin hoti, yahan tak ke al-Dahhak al-Kilabi ne unhen khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen likha ke Ashyam al-Dibabi ki biwi ko us ke shohar ki diyyat me se waris banayen."
"1004","Hum se Muhammad ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humen al-Hasan ibn Salih ne khabar di, Umar ibn Sa'id se, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne khabar di, unhon ne mere dada se riwayat kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Fath-e-Makkah ke din farmaya: do millaton wale ek dusre ke waris nahin honge, aur biwi apne shohar ki diyyat aur us ke maal me se waris hogi, aur wo us ki diyyat aur us ke maal me se waris hoga jab tak ke un me se ek ne dusre ko qatl na kiya ho, phir agar un me se ek ne dusre ko qatl kar diya to wo us ki diyyat aur us ke maal me se kisi cheez ka waris nahin hoga, aur agar un me se ek ne dusre ko ghalti se qatl kiya to wo us ke maal me se waris hoga aur us ki diyyat me se waris nahin hoga."
